tent\":\"commits and pushes the demo;\"}],[\"/quickstart-28\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-28\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#1-create-the-private-demo-repository\",\"content\":\"creates the lifecycle labels and twelve GitHub issues from `.issues/*.json`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-29\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-29\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#1-create-the-private-demo-repository\",\"content\":\"Enter the generated repository:\"}],[\"/quickstart-30\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-30\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#1-create-the-private-demo-repository\",\"content\":\"The generated Workspace contains three configured GitHub Sources:\"}],[\"/quickstart-31\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-31\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#1-create-the-private-demo-repository\",\"content\":\"**implement** — open issues labelled `agentboard:ready-for-agent`;\"}],[\"/quickstart-32\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-32\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#1-create-the-private-demo-repository\",\"content\":\"**review** — open issues labelled `agentboard:ready-for-review`;\"}],[\"/quickstart-33\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-33\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#1-create-the-private-demo-repository\",\"content\":\"**cleanup** — closed issues labelled both `agentboard:review-complete` and `agentboard:cleanup-approved`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-34\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-34\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-mode-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"Start AgentBoard from the standalone repository:\"}],[\"/quickstart-35\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-35\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-mode-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"The launcher uses Herdr when the process runs inside Herdr, Zellij when it runs inside Zellij, and then the first supported desktop terminal. Set `AGENTBOARD_LAUNCHER` to select one explicitly:\"}],[\"/quickstart-36\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-36\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-mode-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"From another terminal, list the seeded issues and release two of them:\"}],[\"/quickstart-37\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-37\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-mode-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"GitHub Search can take several seconds to index a label change. On the next matching run, AgentBoard creates or reuses the issue worktree, installs its JavaScript dependencies with Bun, and launches Pi through the selected launcher.\"}],[\"/quickstart-38\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-38\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"The implementation Pi session reads the issue and implements its written acceptance criteria. On commit, Husky runs lint-staged and ESLint against staged HTML and CSS files. Pi fixes hook failures, pushes, and creates or updates a PR containing `Closes #<issue>`. It then moves the issue to `agentboard:ready-for-review`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-39\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-39\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"The review Source launches a separate reviewer Pi session in the same issue worktree:\"}],[\"/quickstart-40\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-40\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"**Pass:** Pi comments with review evidence, approves and merges the PR, and applies `agentboard:review-complete`. Confirm that the issue is closed.\"}],[\"/quickstart-41\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-41\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"**Changes requested:** Pi comments, applies `agentboard:changes-requested`, and returns the issue to `agentboard:ready-for-agent`. The implementation Source launches another Pi session in the existing worktree.\"}],[\"/quickstart-42\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-42\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"After an accepted PR is merged, apply `agentboard:cleanup-approved` to its closed issue. The cleanup Source removes the issue worktree.\"}],[\"/quickstart-43\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-43\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#4-tear-down-the-throwaway-demo\",\"content\":\"Stop AgentBoard with <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>C</kbd>. Record the repository name, then delete the private GitHub repository:\"}],[\"/quickstart-44\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-44\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#4-tear-down-the-throwaway-demo\",\"content\":\"GitHub may require the `delete_repo` scope. Grant it and retry if deletion fails:\"}],[\"/quickstart-45\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-45\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#4-tear-down-the-throwaway-demo\",\"content\":\"After remote deletion succeeds, leave the directory and remove the local throwaway clone.\"}],[\"/why\",{\"id\":\"/why\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Why AgentBoard\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"AgentBoard\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why\"}],[\"/why-0\",{\"id\":\"/why-0\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#why-agentboard\",\"content\":\"Why AgentBoard\"}],[\"/why-1\",{\"id\":\"/why-1\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-agentboard\",\"content\":\"Task trackers are good at tracking. Agents need repeatable local work queues.\"}],[\"/why-2\",{\"id\":\"/why-2\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-agentboard\",\"content\":\"AgentBoard copies task-like items from sources like QMD-backed markdown into a local store, then runs configured actions such as creating worktrees and launching commands.\"}],[\"/why-3\",{\"id\":\"/why-3\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-agentboard\",\"content\":\"AgentBoard is deliberately not a tracker replacement. Keep truth upstream. Use AgentBoard as the local automation bridge.\"}],[\"/cli/actions\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Actions\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"AgentBoard\",\"Cli\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions\"}],[\"/cli/actions-0\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-0\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Actions\"}],[\"/cli/actions-1\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-1\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#workspace-shape\",\"content\":\"Workspace Shape\"}],[\"/cli/actions-2\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-2\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"Execution Order\"}],[\"/cli/actions-3\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-3\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#retry-identity\",\"content\":\"Retry Identity\"}],[\"/cli/actions-4\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-4\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#action-docs\",\"content\":\"Action Docs\"}],[\"/cli/actions-5\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-5\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#trust-model\",\"content\":\"Trust Model\"}],[\"/cli/actions-6\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-6\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\