_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#list\",\"content\":\"JSON output groups Items by Source and preserves missing versus ready-empty\\nSnapshots:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-21\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-21\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#list\",\"content\":\"Each Source object contains `source_id`, `snapshot` (`missing` or `ready`), and\\nan `items` array. Each Item entry contains `item` and `result`, where `result`\\nis `error`, `pending`, or `success`.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-22\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-22\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#dashboard\",\"content\":\"Open a read-only terminal view of the local Store:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-23\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-23\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#dashboard\",\"content\":\"The Dashboard does not collect Sources, execute Actions, acquire the Run lock,\\nor write Store data. Watch Mode starts enabled and polls once per minute. Use the\\nWatch button to pause or resume polling. Use Left/Right or `h`/`l` to change\\nthe selected Source. Press `e` to expand the footer and show recent events for\\nthe selected Source. The left panel shows workspace actions. The right panel shows\\nfound Items. Use `q` or Ctrl-C to exit. The Dashboard has no in-flight Run view.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-24\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-24\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#show\",\"content\":\"Show one latest stored item and its Action attempts.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-25\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-25\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#show\",\"content\":\"If the same item id exists in multiple Store item buckets, use the qualified form shown in the ambiguity error:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-26\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-26\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[