"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#execution-order\",\"content\":\"They are run concurrently, and when a source has finished retrieving items, its Actions are run sequentially for each item.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-11\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-11\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"After downloading or reading items from a source, agentboard normalizes them into a small model that is stored in the Workspace store.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-12\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-12\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"They are stored in a common shape, so Actions can be written to work with any Source.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-13\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-13\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"Every Source produces normalized items:\"}],[\"/cli/sources-14\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-14\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`id`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-15\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-15\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`reference_id`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-16\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-16\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`title`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-17\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-17\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`status`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-18\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-18\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`url`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-19\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-19\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`source_id`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-20\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-20\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`source_kind`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-21\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-21\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`raw`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-22\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-22\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`raw` keeps the original Source payload so the normalized model can stay small.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-23\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-23\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`id` is the adapter-owned, collision-resistant identity used by the Store and\\nAction retry checks. `reference_id` is the provider-facing identifier intended\\nfor templates, such as GitHub `10` or Jira `ABC-123`.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-24\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-24\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"For Sources with field mapping, the existing `field_map.id` or `map.id` setting\\nselects `reference_id`. It never changes `id`.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-25\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-25\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#source-docs\",\"content\":\"QMD source\"}],[\"/cli/sources-26\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-26\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#source-docs\",\"content\":\"Jira source\"}],[\"/cli/sources-27\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-27\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#source-docs\",\"content\":\"GitHub source\"}],[\"/cli/sources-28\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-28\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"The CLI validates Source ids before a Run:\"}],[\"/cli/sources-29\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-29\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"Source ids must be nonempty.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-30\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-30\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"Source ids must be unique within one Workspace.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-31\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-31\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"Source crates own Source-specific validation and collection behavior.\"}],[\"/cli/store\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Store\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"AgentBoard\",\"Cli\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store\"}],[\"/cli/store-0\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-0\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#store\",\"content\":\"Store\"}],[\"/cli/store-1\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-1\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Location\"}],[\"/cli/store-2\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-2\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"Workspace lock\"}],[\"/cli/store-3\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-3\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"Source collection status\"}],[\"/cli/store-4\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-4\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`items-<source.slug>.jsonl`\"}],[\"/cli/store-5\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-5\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"`actions-<source.slug>-<source.hash>.jsonl`\"}],[\"/cli/store-6\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-6\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"Action Plan Result\"}],[\"/cli/store-7\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-7\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#inspecting-by-hand\",\"content\":\"Inspecting by hand\"}],[\"/cli/store-8\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-8\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#store-schema-migration\",\"content\":\"Store schema migration\"}],[\"/cli/store-9\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-9\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#store\",\"content\":\"The Store contains AgentBoard's append-only records of Item observations, Source\\nSnapshot boundaries, and Action attempts. It also contains the latest collection\\nstatus for each Source.\"}],[\"/cli/store-10\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-10\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#store\",\"content\":\"It is not the source of truth. The tracker or markdown collection remains the source of truth.\"}],[\"/cli/store-11\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-11\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"AgentBoard stores data under the user's XDG data directory:\"}],[\"/cli/store-12\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-12\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"`source.slug` identifies the upstream item universe. For Jira, it is derived from the normalized site URL because Jira issue keys are only unique inside one Jira organization. Two Jira Sources for the same site and different JQL views share an item file.\"}],[\"/cli/store-13\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-13\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"`source.hash` identifies the configured Source view and Action plan. Changing JQL or field mappings creates a new Source Snapshot identity. Changing Actions creates a different Action file without duplicating the Item Store.\"}],[\"/cli/store-14\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-14\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Each `items-<source.slug>.snapshots` record commits one complete Source Snapshot.\\nThe identity includes the configured Source ID, Source kind, and normalized Source\\nconfig. It excludes Actions. A failed or incomplete Run does not replace the\\nlatest committed Snapshot. A committed empty Snapshot is valid.\"}],[\"/cli/store-15\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-15\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Sources that share an Item Store keep separate Snapshot membership and their\\nsource-specific normalized Item values.\"}],[\"/cli/store-16\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-16\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Normal Runs append structured diagnostic events to `events.jsonl`. The global\\n`--log-file` option writes these events to a different path.\"}],[\"/cli/store-17\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-17\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Legacy `sources/<source-id>/items.jsonl` and `sources/<source-id>/actions.jsonl` files are not migrated automatically.\"}],[\"/cli/store-18\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-18\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"Normal `run` and non-dry `run --watch` acquire `run.lock` for the Workspace.\"}],[\"/cli/store-19\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-19\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"`run --dry-run` skips the lock and does not write Store files.\"}],[\"/cli/store-20\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-20\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"`run --watch --dry-run` skips the lock and does not write Store files.\"}],[\"/cli/store-21\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-21\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"A non-dry watched Run holds the lock until it exits.\"}],[\"/cli/store-22\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-22\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"Overlapping normal Runs for the same Workspace fail.\"}],[\"/cli/store-23\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-23\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"Each normal Run writes one `collection-status.json` file for each Source. The\\nstatus is `collecting`, `complete`, `failed`, or `cancelled`.\"}],[\"/cli/store-24\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-24\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"`collecting` means that the Source query is running.\"}],[\"/cli/store-25\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-25\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"`complete` means that the query succeeded and the Snapshot was committed.\"}],[\"/cli/store-26\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-26\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"`failed` means that the query returned an error. The file keeps a short error message.\"}],[\"/cli/store-27\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-27\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"`cancelled` means that collection stopped before the query completed.\"}],[\"/cli/store-28\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-28\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"The file keeps the last status and its update time. If the file says `collecting`\\nbut the Workspace lock is free, the Dashboard treats the status as `cancelled`.\\nCollection status does not replace the authoritative Source Snapshot.\"}],[\"/cli/store-29\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-29\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"Each line is one normalized item observation.\"}],[\"/cli/store-30\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-30\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"Each Item contains both identities:\"}],[\"/cli/store-31\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-31\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`id` — adapter-owned identity used for Store and Action matching.\"}],[\"/cli/store-32\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-32\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`reference_id` — provider-facing reference available to templates.\"}],[\"/cli/store-33\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-33\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"A new Run appends new observations. It does not rewrite older lines.\"}],[\"/cli/store-34\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-34\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`list` reads the latest committed Source Snapshot for each configured Source.\\nIt groups output in Workspace order and does not infer current membership from\\nlegacy Item records. JSON output contains one object per Source and keeps\\nmissing and ready-empty Snapshots distinct.\"}],[\"/cli/store-35\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-35\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl